## Report: `.no-wizard-overview` CSS Styling, HTML Structure, and Animations

### 1. **HTML Structure** (views/pages/contact/index.php, lines 64-66)

```html
<nav class="no-wizard-overview" aria-label="Inquiry steps" data-lenis-prevent
    data-lenis-prevent-wheel data-lenis-prevent-touch>
    <ol class="no-wizard-overview__list" data-wizard-overview-list></ol>
</nav>
```

The wizard overview is populated dynamically via JavaScript (data attributes `data-lenis-prevent` indicate Lenis scroll integration). The `<ol>` contains list items that are injected at runtime with the class `.no-wizard-overview__item`.

---

### 2. **Full Existing CSS for `.no-wizard-overview__button` and `.is-current` Variants**

**File:** `resource/scss/components/_form.scss` (lines 561–818)

#### Base `.no-wizard-overview__button` (lines 596–627):
```scss
&__button {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--gutter-2xs);
  padding: fluid(18, 22);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 6%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 2%, transparent);
  overflow: hidden;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition:
    border-color var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    background-color var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    transform var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth);

  &:disabled {
    cursor: default;
  }

  &.is-framed {
    justify-content: flex-start;
    min-height: auto;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 10%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 4%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
}
```

#### `.is-current` State on Button (lines 784–806):
```scss
&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__button {
  transform: translateX(fluid(2, 4));
}

&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__corner {
  opacity: 1;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 36%, transparent);
}

&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__rect {
  width: calc(fluid(3, 5) * 2);
  margin-right: fluid(8, 10);
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1);

  span {
    animation-play-state: running;
  }
}

&-overview__item.is-current &-overview__value {
  color: var(--clr-text-title);
}
```

#### Hover State on Available Items (lines 812–818):
```scss
@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
  &-overview__item.is-available:not(.is-current) &-overview__button:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 10%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 4%, transparent);
    transform: translateX(fluid(2, 4));
  }
}
```

