### 3. **Child Elements and Their Styling**

#### `.no-wizard-overview__item` (lines 583–594):
```scss
&__item {
  opacity: 0.4;
  transition: opacity var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth);

  &.is-available {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  &.is-current {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}
```

#### `.no-wizard-overview__rect` (lines 638–654) — Animation trigger:
```scss
&__rect {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 0;
  margin-right: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translate3d(-8px, 0, 0) scale(0.92);
  transition:
    width var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    margin-right var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    opacity var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    transform var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth);

  span {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
}
```
When `.is-current` activates, the animation plays via `animation-play-state: running` on its child `span` elements.

#### `.no-wizard-overview__corner` (lines 677–683):
```scss
&__corner {
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 22%, transparent);
  opacity: 0;
  transition:
    opacity var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth),
    color var(--duration-default) var(--ease-smooth);
}
```

#### `.no-wizard-overview__value` and `.no-wizard-overview__index` (lines 656–705):
```scss
&__index {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--family-en-title);
  color: var(--clr-text-desc);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

&__value {
  min-width: 0;
  width: 100%;
  color: var(--clr-text-desc);
  line-height: 1.4;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: normal;

  &.is-chip-list {
